# thor-tasks
#
# The Thor task definitions: for each named task, the ^desireds that define it (single action, double action 
# with/without ordering, temporal, sequences, disjunctive).
#
# Requires: thor-soar.
# Loaded by: thor.soar
#
# Contents (rules per file)
#      3  elaborations/desireds-disjunctive.soar: Tasks with disjunctive desireds.
#     10  elaborations/desireds-double-no-seq.soar: Two-action tasks without ordering.
#      6  elaborations/desireds-double-seq.soar: Two-action tasks with ordering.
#      9  elaborations/desireds-double-temporal.soar: Two-action tasks with temporal constraints.
#      2  elaborations/desireds-sequence.soar: Longer action sequences.
#     38  elaborations/desireds-single.soar: Single-action tasks; none use fixed object handles; alphabetic by operator name.
#     93  elaborations/desireds.soar: Task desireds by task name (one-step and general tasks).
